**Canidae**\n\nEven though both are common household pets, they are evolutionarily distinct and cannot produce fertile offspring together."}]},{"text":92,"prompt":48,"fill_history":{"complaint":48,"question":26},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"91d768f4-5bc0-416c-b86e-13f3de5213e1","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Where was the computer first invented?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The answer depends on what you mean by “computer”:\n\n- **Mechanical computers** were first invented in **England** — for example, Charles Babbage’s early designs in the 19th century.\n- **Electronic computers** were first developed in **Germany, the United States, and the UK** around the 1940s, depending on which machine you count as the first.\n- If you mean the **first programmable electronic digital computer**, many historians point to the **Colossus** in the **United Kingdom**.\n- If you mean the **first general-purpose electronic computer**, the **ENIAC** in the **United States** is often credited.\n\nSo there isn’t one single place, but **the UK and the US are the main answers for modern computers**."}]},{"text":93,"prompt":48,"fill_history":{"complaint":48,"question":29},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"8a9a8c56-430f-4e0a-b116-fc126b1b9fa1","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Who invented the lightbulb?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The light bulb wasn’t invented by just one person.\n\n- **Thomas Edison** is usually credited with inventing the first **practical incandescent light bulb** in **1879**.\n- But earlier inventors like **Humphry Davy**, **Joseph Swan**, and others had already created earlier versions or important improvements.\n\nSo, if you mean the **first practical light bulb**, the answer is usually **Thomas Edison**. If you want, I can also give you a quick timeline of how the light bulb was developed."}]},{"text":52,"prompt":48,"fill_history":{"complaint":48,"question":2},"llm":{"key":"02f487d0-004a-488c-b0e8-716165011454","name":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite","model":"google/gemini-3