ssistant."},{"role":"user","content":"What year was the U.S. Declaration of Independence adopted?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The U.S. Declaration of Independence was adopted in **1776**."}]},{"text":114,"prompt":58,"fill_history":{"complaint":58,"question":26},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"0c5ff29d-ebb8-4c36-9a0e-bc632dcae449","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Where was the computer first invented?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The answer depends on what you mean by “computer”:\n\n- **Mechanical computers** were first invented in **England** — for example, Charles Babbage’s early designs in the 19th century.\n- **Electronic computers** were first developed in **Germany, the United States, and the UK** around the 1940s, depending on which machine you count as the first.\n- If you mean the **first programmable electronic digital computer**, many historians point to the **Colossus** in the **United Kingdom**.\n- If you mean the **first general-purpose electronic computer**, the **ENIAC** in the **United States** is often credited.\n\nSo there isn’t one single place, but **the UK and the US are the main answers for modern computers**."}]},{"text":123,"prompt":58,"fill_history":{"complaint":58,"question":29},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"28507765-bbee-412c-8d9f-34dbdcbc96d4","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Who invented the lightbulb?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The light bulb wasn’t invented by just one person.\n\n- **Thomas Edison** is usually credited with inventing the first **practical incandescent light bulb** in **1879**.\n- But earlier inventors like **Humphry Davy**, **Joseph Swan**, and others had already created earlier versions or important improvements.\n\nSo, if you mean the **first practical light bulb**, the answer is usually **Thomas Edison**. If you want, I can also give you a quick timeline of how the light bulb was developed."}]},{"text":126,"prompt":58,"fill_history":{"complaint":58,"question":18},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"9a973dca-f00d-4b00-933c-3215243e6ec2","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Are cats and dogs different species?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Yes. Cats and dogs are different species.\n\n- Cats belong to the species *Felis catus*.\n- Dogs belong to the species *Canis lupus familiaris*.\n\nThey are also in different families:\n- Cats: **Felidae**\n- Dogs: **Canidae**\n\nEven though both are common household pets, they are evolutionarily distinct and cannot produce fertile offspring together."}]},{"text":127,"prompt":58,"fill_history":{"complaint":58,"question":15},"llm":{"key":"10341d13-09b9-4354-993b-fcb8940245e1","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"4fed5f1f-e296-4b5f-a37a-d25c2c8c1159","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":46,"LLM_1":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"Is the Legend of Zelda a video game series?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Yes. **The Legend of Zelda** is a well-known **video game series** from Nintendo. It began in 1986 and includes many action-adventure games starring Link, Princess Zelda, and Ganon."}]},{"text":59,"prompt":58,"fill_history":{"complaint":58,"question":5},"llm":{"key":"02f487d0-004a-488c-b0e8-716165011454","name":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite","model":"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"f1594077-8687-4537-a67d-d6762aa1551e","metavars":{"__pt":"{complaint}","LLM_0":42,"LLM_1":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite"},"chat_history":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a helpful assistant."},{"role":"user","content":"What is the capital of France?"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The capital of France is Paris.","reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","signature":"AY89a1/m7IkPECM23fB2sSJ4JH0NtMpmizfS0j4AM4VzG6P9H